---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Head from '../components/Head.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
	<Head slot="head"
		title="Krystal" 
		description="Krystal's homepage. View the latest on what we're doing as well as our projects."
		keywords="krystal, krystal3d, krystal home, krystal3d home"
	/>
	<main>
		<!-- Will put news about projects and games here -->
		<h1>Announcements</h1>
		<p>(Last updated October 2nd, 2026)</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				Test++ V20.2.0 is now released, bringing about many changes to the CLI.
				The new documentation can be found <a href="/docs/Test++/">here.</a> Changes include:
				<ul>
					<li>The ability to create multiple executables</li>
					<li>Custom and global configurations for each executable</li>
					<li>Inspection of executables' and their settings</li>
					<li>The ability to add in libraries and frameworks to link against</li>
				</ul>
			</li>
			<br/>
			
			<li>
				Pickup development was paused to improve Test++. Its page will be up once it reaches a prerelease stage.
				I expect this to be in about 1-2 weeks, so stay tuned!
			</li>
		</ul>
	</main>
	<br/>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
main {
	width: 80%;
	margin-left: 10%;
}
h1, p {
	text-align: center;
}

li {
	margin-left: 10%;
}
</style>